    {
      "text": "Where wind intertwines like willows and moves about continuously in plain sight, Pi Shui Han descends and names the resource a rank seven immortal material, green jade wind. Unfettered Scholar appears at once and claims the material as his own, telling Pi Shui Han to go elsewhere. Both are rank seven experts; they resume a prior Tai Qiu stalemate and choose to fight over it rather than yield.",
